      "setup": "Register a GitHub App using [Register a GitHub App](https://docs.github.com/en/apps/creating-github-apps/registering-a-github-app/registering-a-github-app), then generate a private key for the app and create a JWT as described under GitHub App authentication in [About authentication with a GitHub App](https://docs.github.com/en/apps/creating-github-apps/authenticating-with-a-github-app/about-authentication-with-a-github-app). Use this when an endpoint specifically requires authenticating as the app itself.",
      "acquisition": "manual"
